             :intent "`my.program/breaks` on the namespace subject seon.turn took 5542 ms and 5876 ms on default's JVM, against 183 ms for the function subject `seon.render.value/render-ai`, so the test schema-and-namespace-reads-keep-different-connections-distinct exceeds its 5000 ms bound. Find what the namespace branch of breaks is proportional to (owned declarations, gate names, requiring namespaces) and make it sub-second; done when that test passes inside its bound."
             :must-read #{my.program/breaks seon.fn/gate-sets seon.fn/gating-tests}
